WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,410
It's not bad for Bao'er to be in a daze like this

2
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:13,010
I was given the elixir just yesterday

3
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:26,560
Why do you get hungry so quickly?

4
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,560
good guy

5
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:32,540
How dare you give me a ball face?

6
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:34,540
I'll spare you because you don't have bad intentions.

7
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,540
Forget it this time

8
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,540
The elixir to punish you tomorrow is gone

9
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,540
You are not allowed to steal the spiritual value of important people either.

10
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:45,950
Otherwise I won't want you

11
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,950
Rare wood-phantom dual-attribute spirit beast

12
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:49,950
I will be an adult for at least five years in the future

13
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:50,950
little guy

14
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:52,950
The third spiritual beast I broke through three times is currently unaccounted for.

15
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:59,400
If you have a chance in the future, would you like to contract with me?

16
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,400
It's scary. Let's go.

17
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:05,730
The young master is not well

18
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:07,730
The manager asked you to go find him immediately
